Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 14:08:52 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 4/5] feat(web): expose checksum settings and recompute actions

Adds an admin Checksums section for external library checksums, the fixed
content SHA-1 upload checksum, upload de-duplication and background
recompute buttons. Includes en/zh_Hans strings and updates the e2e config
fixture.
